  "notes": "Restores the intended two-mode header background behavior. With Use Separate Header Image OFF, the normal main background image is once again one continuous site background behind the AO3 header, navigation, page, and footer. With it ON, the main background is confined to the page while the header uses its own independent image/GIF. Header/profile/navigation content remains visible in both modes, Fixed Background remains available, and switching modes immediately re-renders local image layers without changing saved image settings."
